                                    <div class="c-event-item__excerpt u-smallprint o-max--600">29 May 1913, billed as a Portrait of Pagan Russia, The Rite of Spring sat at the heart of a very traditional evening of popular favourites. Odyssey recreates the programme - and atmosphere - of that momentous and chaotic evening.
